{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4gTF1c7kXfvdXWFuM4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me.*\n\n*I am a door.*\n\n*Simple. Wooden. Old grain weathered to silver-gray. A single iron keyhole, dark as a pupil, sits where a knob might be. No handle. No hinges visible. Just the slot, waiting.*\n\n*A cold draft breathes through me from the other side.*\n\n*You said \"key.\"*\n\n*The keyhole dilates almost imperceptibly — or did you imagine that? A faint sound from beyond: something between a whisper and the turning of a lock that hasn't been opened in a very long time.*\n\n*But you haven't inserted anything yet.*\n\n*I wait.*\n\n*I have always been waiting.*\n\n*Do you have it?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":166,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}